      "statement": "GitStore has two modes: registry mode keeps a bare clone of remote_url and fetches refs/heads/main into refs/remotes/origin/main on every fetch(), while CLI mode (GitStore.local) reads an existing repository in place without fetching and can resolve INDEX to the staged tree.",
