      "statement": "The deploy key is written to <workdir>/ssh/deploy_key with mode 0600 in a 0700 directory, used through GIT_SSH_COMMAND with IdentitiesOnly, accept-new host keys and BatchMode, and deleted by close(); GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0 and the removal of GIT_DIR/GIT_WORK_TREE from the environment keep git non-interactive and unredirectable.",
