      "statement": "In registry mode GitStore writes a private global git config containing safe.directory=* and points GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL at it, because safe.directory is only honoured from protected scopes and the file:// upload-pack child ignores -c and GIT_CONFIG_* overrides; CLI mode leaves the user's global config untouched.",
