    {
      "id": "claim_998edb0b550e4c0a9a9cbd839c4114a6",
      "statement": "GitStore.archive_skill produces a byte-deterministic, size-bounded tar of one skill version: it reads the commit time with git show, runs git archive with --mtime pinned to it and -c tar.umask=0022 -c core.attributesfile=/dev/null on <commit>:skills/<name>, streams stdout into a mkstemp file while enforcing max_bytes (ArchiveTooLarge kills the child), writes stderr to a temporary file, reaps the child on every exit path and publishes only a complete file via os.replace; git failures are GitError (a ContentError).",
